    {
      "id": "roMLwME-XWqzjLVAiY1cB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5938.771446128188,
      "y": 6833.596049777169,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 96.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#664d00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1501960812,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 1555221460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781875307541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "①  SHARED BUILD  (same ContentId + PackageFamilyName)\n1. FetchingContentIds reads GetPackageIdentity → PlaytestContentId + PFN of the\n   already-published packages.\n2. These become StoreAsset.ContentId + PackageFamilyName.\n3. CTIN keys asset ingestion by SourceId = StoreAsset.ContentId (set-equal by\n   construction). 4. Same ContentId ⇒ SUCU returns the same staged versions + the\n   same store-CDN download URI — no new bytes. 5. PFN is asset metadata + PC-required.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "①  SHARED BUILD  (same ContentId + PackageFamilyName)\n1. FetchingContentIds reads GetPackageIdentity → PlaytestContentId + PFN of the\n   already-published packages.\n2. These become StoreAsset.ContentId + PackageFamilyName.\n3. CTIN keys asset ingestion by SourceId = StoreAsset.ContentId (set-equal by\n   construction). 4. Same ContentId ⇒ SUCU returns the same staged versions + the\n   same store-CDN download URI — no new bytes. 5. PFN is asset metadata + PC-required.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bBz",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "twtNYd0Za697lXMmqQouu",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 6582.771446128188,
      "y": 6821.596049777169,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59f00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1294986476,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 1972515156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781875307541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bC0"
    },
    {
      "id": "Md9AA4jFfrNm5QaiCPimI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6598.771446128188,
      "y": 6833.596049777169,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 82.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#664d00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 16478060,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 1483269844,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781875307541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "②  WHERE THE BINARY GOES  (it doesn't move)\nCTIN is catalog/orchestration only — it never touches package bytes. The\nAssetIngestion job looks the asset up by SourceId and asks SUCU/XUS for changed\nversions, getting a store-CDN download URI. The bytes already live in Blob/CDN from\nthe developer's flighted publish; the PC server pulls from the store CDN.\nGRTS / Garrison / MKMS / ESRP / CMX are NOT in the streaming-ingestion path.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "②  WHERE THE BINARY GOES  (it doesn't move)\nCTIN is catalog/orchestration only — it never touches package bytes. The\nAssetIngestion job looks the asset up by SourceId and asks SUCU/XUS for changed\nversions, getting a store-CDN download URI. The bytes already live in Blob/CDN from\nthe developer's flighted publish; the PC server pulls from the store CDN.\nGRTS / Garrison / MKMS / ESRP / CMX are NOT in the streaming-ingestion path.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bC1",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "y96LyajWZaeMDHuPIjkau",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 7242.771446128188,
      "y": 6821.596049777169,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59f00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
